{"unit_id": "tag:02J1:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n设点<MATH_0002>属于<MATH_0003>。称该点为<TEXTITOPEN_0001>有限型点（finite type point）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，条件是典范态射（canonical morphism）<MATH_0004>为有限型（finite type）。\n记<MATH_0005>为<MATH_0006>的有限型点（finite type points）所成的集合（set）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "指本定义所取的概形。"}, {"source_term": "finite type point", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "本段定义的术语，使用单数词形。"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射", "context": "指判定该点是否为有限型点的典范态射。"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型", "context": "描述典范态射的性质。"}, {"source_term": "finite type points", "target_term": "有限型点", "context": "指集合中的有限型点，原文使用复数词形。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "指该概形所有有限型点所成的集合。"}], "notes": []}
